Body:
This was a bug on xai server side, replicated even using this:
```
Name: "task"
Schema:
{
  "type": "object",
  "properties": {
    "name": { "type": "string" }
  },
  "required": ["name"],
  "additionalProperties": false
}

the llm will always call it w/ a task_id:
{
  "name": "demo",
  "task_id": "784c32db-e6ec-4b63-a3ef-0064885cb837"
}
```

Contacted Xai and they resolved the issue on their end about 8hrs ago or so.
